{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,18]],"date-time":"2026-10-18T02:29:52Z","timestamp":1792290592549,"version":"4.4.0"},"reference-count":74,"publisher":"American Geophysical Union (AGU)","issue":"16","license":[{"start":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,24]],"date-time":"2026-08-24T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1787529600000},"content-version":"vor","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"http:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by\/4.0\/"},{"start":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,24]],"date-time":"2026-08-24T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1787529600000},"content-version":"tdm","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"http:\/\/doi.wiley.com\/10.1002\/tdm_license_1.1"}],"funder":[{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001659","name":"Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["534049325"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["534049325"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001659","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001659","name":"Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["531801029\u2013TRR 410"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["531801029\u2013TRR 410"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001659","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001659","name":"Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["WETSCAPES2.0"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["WETSCAPES2.0"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001659","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100004493","name":"International Atomic Energy Agency","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["F31008"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["F31008"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100004493","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]}],"content-domain":{"domain":["agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com"],"crossmark-restriction":true},"short-container-title":["JGR Atmospheres"],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,28]]},"abstract":"<jats:title>Abstract<\/jats:title>\n                  <jats:p>\n                    With advances in global and regional circulation models, the high\u2010resolution simulation of atmospheric variables has become increasingly feasible. In this study, we use IsoRSM, an isotope\u2010enabled regional spectral model, to improve the simulation of precipitation and its isotopic composition over tropical Costa Rica, which is marked by a pronounced topography and is surrounded by two oceans. A 14\u2010year (2010\u20132023) simulation was performed at a relatively high spatial (5\u00a0km) and temporal (6\u2010hourly) resolution over a 6\u00b0\u00a0\u00d7\u00a06\u00b0 domain covering Costa Rica and surrounding regions. Model outputs were evaluated using observations from 58 precipitation\u2010amount sites and 27 isotope\u2010monitoring sites and were compared with a 10\u00a0km IsoRSM simulation from a previous study over a larger spatial domain. After applying quantile mapping (QM) bias correction, the model generally captured the spatial patterns and seasonal cycles of precipitation inputs and precipitation isotopes across Costa Rica. The mean Kling\u2010Gupta efficiency (KGE) for bias\u2010corrected precipitation \u03b4\n                    <jats:sup>2<\/jats:sup>\n                    H reached 0.43, and the 5\u00a0km simulation outperformed the previous 10\u00a0km run, highlighting the benefits of improved topographic representation. IsoRSM also clearly simulated the \u03b4\n                    <jats:sup>2<\/jats:sup>\n                    H\u2010\u03b4\n                    <jats:sup>18<\/jats:sup>\n                    O relationship and the interannual variability along the topographical gradient of Costa Rica. Thus, the bias\u2010corrected IsoRSM outputs offer a promising source of simulated data for further application, such as the forcing data for isotope\u2010enabled eco\u2010hydrological models.\n                  <\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1029\/2026jd046723","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,24]],"date-time":"2026-08-24T17:15:52Z","timestamp":1787591752000},"update-policy":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1002\/crossmark_policy","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":1,"title":["High\u2010Resolution Regional Atmospheric Simulation of Precipitation and Isotopes in Central America"],"prefix":"10.1029","volume":"131","author":[{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0009-0000-4568-8791","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Yan","family":"Yang","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Ecohydrology and Biogeochemistry Leibniz\u2010Institute of Freshwater Ecology and Inland Fisheries (IGB)  Berlin Germany"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-6792-852X","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Christian","family":"Birkel","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Ecohydrology and Biogeochemistry Leibniz\u2010Institute of Freshwater Ecology and Inland Fisheries (IGB)  Berlin Germany"},{"name":"Department of Geography University of Costa Rica  San Pedro Costa Rica"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Chris","family":"Soulsby","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Northern Rivers Institute University of Aberdeen  Aberdeen UK"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Ana M.","family":"Dur\u00e1n\u2010Quesada","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"School of Physics &amp; Environmental Pollution Research Center University of Costa Rica  San Pedro Costa Rica"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0001-8721-8093","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Ricardo","family":"S\u00e1nchez\u2010Murillo","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Earth and Environmental Sciences The University of Texas at Arlington  Arlington TX USA"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-6890-6509","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Germain","family":"Esquivel\u2010Hern\u00e1ndez","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Stable Isotopes Research Group and Water Resources Management Laboratory School of Chemistry Universidad Nacional  Heredia Costa Rica"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-5761-1561","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Kei","family":"Yoshimura","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Institute of Industrial Science The University of Tokyo  Chiba Japan"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-7183-8674","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"D\u00f6rthe","family":"Tetzlaff","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Ecohydrology and Biogeochemistry Leibniz\u2010Institute of Freshwater Ecology and Inland Fisheries (IGB)  Berlin Germany"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"13","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,24]]},"reference":[{"key":"e_1_2_11_2_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1002\/hyp.14884"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_3_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.5194\/essd\u201012\u2010629\u20102020"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_4_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1029\/2010WR009689"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_5_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1002\/hyp.14153"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_6_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.scitotenv.2024.178242"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_7_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1029\/2023JD038719"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_8_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1038\/s41612\u2010025\u201000955\u20108"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_9_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/s00442\u2010004\u20101813\u2010y"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_10_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1130\/0091-7613(2002)030<0315:SDOOIM>2.0.CO;2"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_11_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.5194\/cp\u201017\u20101685\u20102021"},{"key":"e_1_2_11_12_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI